                <pb facs="0224" n="116" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg116"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic">January 29,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham instructs Mr. Thompson to confer with Admiral Benham, from whom a
                    telegram, indicating a serious situation, has been received, and requests an
                    immediate report.</p>
            </div>
